Depth-3 graded piece (Balakrishnan-Dogra II / Hashimoto-Best leading order):
  g = 5,  rho_NS = 5
  dim gr^3 U_dR (leading) = (4g^3 - g)/3 - 2g rho = 115
  Bloch-Kato Selmer local delta_3 ≈ gr3/2 ≈ 115/2

Cubic-Chabauty admissibility (depth 3): r < g + rho - 1 + delta_3
                                         = 5 + 5 - 1 + delta_3
                                        >= 9 + 57 = 66
All three fibers have r_hi in [10, 13], deeply inside the window.

